{"id":"en_scarlet-throne","title":"Scarlet Throne","titleEn":"Scarlet Throne","description":"Betrayed by his fiancée Ivy Young, Imperial Heir Mason Shaw barely survives, reduced to life as a beggar. In that lowest state he crosses paths with Zoe Stone, a courtesan whose past is shrouded in mystery. The two draw closer, and through her Mason begins to see the shape of a conspiracy that reaches to his own brother, Miles Shaw, and to foreign allies working alongside him. With Zoe at his side, Mason sets out to win back his throne and to clear the name of her father. Yet the more secrets come to light, the harder their bond of love and loyalty is pressed, leaving open whether they can overcome the betrayal and deceit around them and build a future together.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/scarlet-throne/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/scarlet-throne/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Betrayal","Palace","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dmpfg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_scarlet-throne_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dmpfg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_scarlet-throne_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dmpfg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_scarlet-throne_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dmpfg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_scarlet-throne_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://r